{
 "hook-1": {
  "audioSec": 7.5,
  "audioFrames": 225,
  "duration": 234,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "chapter": "hook",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "你在网上搜一个订单号，成千上万条记录里，结果一下子就出来了。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 5.404,
    "src": "ch1-1"
   },
   {
    "text": "数据库是怎么做到的？",
    "start": 5.684,
    "dur": 1.832,
    "src": "ch1-2"
   }
  ]
 },
 "hook-2": {
  "audioSec": 6.2,
  "audioFrames": 186,
  "duration": 249,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 234,
  "chapter": "hook",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "其实，它跟你查一本厚书的办法差不多。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 3.125,
    "src": "ch1-3"
   },
   {
    "text": "这一期，就来讲讲数据库的索引。",
    "start": 3.401,
    "dur": 2.792,
    "src": "ch1-4"
   }
  ],
  "origDuration": 246,
  "holdAt": 246,
  "extraHold": 3,
  "labelHold": 3
 },
 "scan-1": {
  "audioSec": 7.5,
  "audioFrames": 225,
  "duration": 233,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "chapter": "scan",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "先看笨办法。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 1.365,
    "src": "ch2-1"
   },
   {
    "text": "一本没有目录的厚书，想找一句话，只能从第一页开始，一页一页往后翻。",
    "start": 1.645,
    "dur": 5.843,
    "src": "ch2-2"
   }
  ]
 },
 "scan-2": {
  "audioSec": 12.833,
  "audioFrames": 385,
  "duration": 445,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 233,
  "chapter": "scan",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "数据库也一样：没有索引的时候，它只能从第一行开始，一行一行把整张表读一遍，这叫全表扫描。",
    "start": 0.001,
    "dur": 9.019,
    "src": "ch2-3"
   },
   {
    "text": "表小的时候还好，表一大，就很慢。",
    "start": 9.3,
    "dur": 3.528,
    "src": "ch2-4"
   }
  ]
 },
 "index-1": {
  "audioSec": 6.867,
  "audioFrames": 206,
  "duration": 214,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "chapter": "index",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "聪明的办法是先查目录。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 2.322,
    "src": "ch3-1"
   },
   {
    "text": "目录记着每个内容在第几页，查到页码，直接翻过去。",
    "start": 2.602,
    "dur": 4.267,
    "src": "ch3-2"
   }
  ]
 },
 "index-2": {
  "audioSec": 11.367,
  "audioFrames": 341,
  "duration": 401,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 214,
  "chapter": "index",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "给数据库的某一列建一份这样的目录，就叫索引。",
    "start": 0.016,
    "dur": 3.724,
    "src": "ch3-3"
   },
   {
    "text": "这份索引，记着每个值存在哪儿，数据库查一下，就能直接跳到要找的那一行，比一行一行读快很多。",
    "start": 4.02,
    "dur": 7.337,
    "src": "ch3-4"
   }
  ]
 },
 "btree-1": {
  "audioSec": 9.0,
  "audioFrames": 270,
  "duration": 278,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "chapter": "btree",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "可目录本身也会很厚。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 1.989,
    "src": "ch4-1"
   },
   {
    "text": "所以数据库把目录做成好几层：大目录指到小目录，小目录再指到具体的位置。",
    "start": 2.269,
    "dur": 6.73,
    "src": "ch4-2"
   }
  ]
 },
 "btree-2": {
  "audioSec": 7.367,
  "audioFrames": 221,
  "duration": 281,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 278,
  "chapter": "btree",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "从最上面一层往下，翻几层就找到了。",
    "start": 0.012,
    "dur": 3.363,
    "src": "ch4-3"
   },
   {
    "text": "这种一层套一层的多层目录，叫B 加树。",
    "start": 3.655,
    "dur": 3.701,
    "src": "ch4-4"
   }
  ]
 },
 "more-1": {
  "audioSec": 17.733,
  "audioFrames": 532,
  "duration": 540,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "chapter": "more",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "那目录是不是越多越好？",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 2.307,
    "src": "ch5-1"
   },
   {
    "text": "不是。",
    "start": 2.587,
    "dur": 0.87,
    "src": "ch5-2"
   },
   {
    "text": "书里加一页或撕掉一页，所有目录都得跟着改；只改某页上的内容，只有按这部分内容编的目录要跟着改；目录本身也占纸；目录一多，光挑用哪一本都要花时间。",
    "start": 3.737,
    "dur": 13.989,
    "src": "ch5-3"
   }
  ],
  "revoice": "v0.26.3 Knoll 补录实测（/workspace/share/v0263/out，2026-10-16）"
 },
 "more-2": {
  "audioSec": 8.667,
  "audioFrames": 260,
  "duration": 320,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 540,
  "chapter": "more",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "数据库也一样：索引会拖慢写入，占用空间，还要花时间挑用哪一个。",
    "start": 0.006,
    "dur": 5.926,
    "src": "ch5-4"
   },
   {
    "text": "所以，索引不是越多越好。",
    "start": 6.212,
    "dur": 2.444,
    "src": "ch5-5"
   }
  ]
 },
 "recap-1": {
  "audioSec": 12.567,
  "audioFrames": 377,
  "duration": 385,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 0,
  "chapter": "recap",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "放在一起看：没有目录，只能全表扫描；建了索引，先查目录再直达；多层目录让很大的表也能很快找到；可目录也要维护，够用就好。",
    "start": 0.0,
    "dur": 12.568,
    "src": "ch6-1"
   }
  ]
 },
 "recap-2": {
  "audioSec": 4.967,
  "audioFrames": 149,
  "duration": 209,
  "chapterOffsetFrames": 385,
  "chapter": "recap",
  "provisional": false,
  "engine": "knoll",
  "scale": 1,
  "sentences": [
   {
    "text": "下次你一下子就搜到了订单，背后其实是一份排好的目录。",
    "start": 0.015,
    "dur": 4.938,
